--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Subtitles_Ulgrin_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 605b41dca1993c745b46ca4ad39c2c6b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 9940049920
    m_Localized: Control, this is Agent Ulgrin. I need a request to open up Cell
      3-11.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 316558152376320
    m_Localized: Copy that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 327228839239680
    m_Localized: Just follow me. Oh and by the way, we're authorized to kill any
      disobedient test subjects, so don't try anything stupid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 327306861682688
    m_Localized: Just follow me. Oh and by the way, we're authorized to uh.. exterminate
      any disobedient test subjects, so I'd recommend not doing anything stupid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 327969356193792
    m_Localized: '*chuckle* You have got to be the dumbest test subject we''ve ever
      had.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328736678944768
    m_Localized: Oh well, shut the doors and open the gas valves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328891142578176
    m_Localized: Huh.. I'm actually kind of disappointed you didn't put up a fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328899015286784
    m_Localized: I was looking forward to punching you in the face.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328921186377728
    m_Localized: Look buddy, I don't have all day. I'm trying to be polite about
      this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 331076421099520
    m_Localized: If you don't step out of the cell, I'm gonna kick your ass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 333629179371520
    m_Localized: What, are you stupid or something? I said step out of the cell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 333649794375680
    m_Localized: If you don't step out of the cell, I'm gonna kick your ass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 333758183579648
    m_Localized: Hey, they've got some work for you. Do me a favor, and step out
      of your cell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343178812661760
    m_Localized: Hey, dumbass! You're going the wrong way. Get the hell over here
      right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344076913811456
    m_Localized: Alright you know what? Fine. Be that way. We'll just get somebody
      else then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344103769939968
    m_Localized: Alright fine, be that way. We'll just get somebody else then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344136531648512
    m_Localized: I ain't in the mood for this shit. I have no problem putting a bullet
      in your brain if you don't start cooperating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344177921040384
    m_Localized: I'm not in the mood for this shit. I have no problem putting a bullet
      in your head if you don't start cooperating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344239292096512
    m_Localized: Hurry up! They're waiting for you. (in the test chamber....)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344270371889152
    m_Localized: Look, dude, I already hate my job. Why are you making it more difficult
      for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344723411247104
    m_Localized: Well, we're here. Just get in there, and follow all the instructions,
      and uh.. you'll probably be fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344840881119232
    m_Localized: Well, we're here. I'm still disappointed I didn't get to punch you..
      but whatever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344854973980672
    m_Localized: Well, we're here. I'm still disappointed I didn't get to punch you
      in the face.. but whatever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344863253536768
    m_Localized: Just get in there, and follow all the instructions and uh... you'll
      probably be fine. Or maybe you won't be. Either way, I don't really care.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 344869012316160
    m_Localized: Well anyway, let's not waste any more time. They're waiting for
      you down at the chamber.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 345727510847488
    m_Localized: Oh, and by the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 345785463545856
    m_Localized: So.. uhh.. how's it goin'?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346127701975040
    m_Localized: Yeah who do you think I'm talking to? This guy here with the punchable
      face? Of course I'm talking to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346287395905536
    m_Localized: Well yeah.. it's your first day working here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346332199460864
    m_Localized: Really? Wow. That's weird.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346464827547648
    m_Localized: Uh.. so you see any good movies lately?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346536906661888
    m_Localized: Yeah? What kind of books?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346583526350848
    m_Localized: '*chuckle* You''re kidding me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346642804449280
    m_Localized: Your whole job revolves around horror and science fiction. Except
      you know, it's not actually fiction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346761331286016
    m_Localized: Yeah look no offense, but I've already lost interest in what you're
      talking about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346830260477952
    m_Localized: Man I'm hungry. Hey, today's pizza day down at the cafeteria right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 346946228789248
    m_Localized: Oh, goddamnit. Well, my day's ruined. The only reason I still come
      here is for the pizza. I don't know what it is about that pizza, but it's delicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347131432476672
    m_Localized: Tuna casserole, on the other hand, is a disgusting abomination,
      and it should be locked up in here with the rest of these freaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347361657823232
    m_Localized: You don't have a girlfriend, do you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347423154708480
    m_Localized: Well I'm definitely not a mind reader, otherwise I'd be locked up
      in this place, so yeah, I'd say it's pretty damn obvious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347632542752768
    m_Localized: Tell her you work at some coffee shop or something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347720908349440
    m_Localized: Ah I don't know. Just tell her it's uh- ketchup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347805134168064
    m_Localized: Oh just forget it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347841024827392
    m_Localized: Uh, so you see any good movies lately?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 347904212017152
    m_Localized: Oh okay, what about video games? You know that reminds me, somebody
      should make a video game based on this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 348118993936384
    m_Localized: Eh I don't know, I just thought it was kind of a cool idea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
